---
layout: base.njk
title: 구축 사례
lead: 산업 현장에 적용한 KRNA의 자동화 시스템입니다.
permalink: /cases/
---
<section class="sec">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="filters" role="tablist" aria-label="산업 분류">
      <button class="on" data-filter="all">전체 <span>{{ collections.cases.length }}</span></button>
      {% for ind in categories.industries %}{% set n = collections.cases | where("industry", ind) %}{% if n.length %}
      <button data-filter="{{ ind }}">{{ ind }} <span>{{ n.length }}</span></button>{% endif %}{% endfor %}
      {% set sf = collections.cases | where("type", "smart-factory") %}<button data-filter="smart-factory">스마트 공장 <span>{{ sf.length }}</span></button>
      {% set gv = 0 %}{% for c in collections.cases %}{% if c.data.gov %}{% set gv = gv + 1 %}{% endif %}{% endfor %}{% if gv %}<button data-filter="gov">로봇 실증사업 <span>{{ gv }}</span></button>{% endif %}
    </div>
    <div class="case-grid" id="caseGrid">
      {% for c in collections.cases %}{% include "case-card.njk" %}{% endfor %}
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
